        "rationale": "The agent correctly identified the asset (Transformer 1 at MAIN), the window, and the peak-acetylene sample (2024-01-17, 8 ppm), and the reported gas and current values are consistent with the sensor_stats ranges shown in the trace. It transparently reported that fmsr.interpret_dga failed and fell back to a manual IEC/Rogers ratio and Duval computation, which is a reasonable and honest recovery rather than a fabricated result. The three modes are ranked with confidences, load correlation is asse",
